# Knotted trunk (#635): the decor kind `trunk-knot`, native 28x288, one frame; the second tree shape, so two trunks on one
# screen do not stamp the same bark. Bark columns, cap and roots as trunk.grid (D122: branch roots lie on the same columns).
# Its body rows are trunk.grid's, copied as typed and started further down; a hollow, a burl on the shadow side, a stub on
# the moon side and two moss patches are typed. Palette: trunk.grid's (D120, D130).
size 28 288
color f 220e09
color d 28130e
color m 2e1813
color r 39231d
color l 47302a
color h 454339
color g 1b2416
color k 1c0805
frame trunk-knot
